{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1366995-bright-forging-prana-recommendations","id":1366995,"title":"Bright-Forging Prana recommendations","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-02-11T09:01:08-08:00","id":1366995,"title":"Bright-Forging Prana recommendations","content":"My friend's character has I think Int 5, Craft 5, Flawless Handiwork Method and Bright-Forging Prana. He asked me what charms to use for Bright-Forging Prana.<br /> <br /> My advice was: <span style=\"color:black\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">For a level 2 or 3 Artefact:</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:black\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">Supreme Masterwork Focus x2 (1 gold point, 1wp, get double 8s)</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">Experiential Conjuring of the Void (spend 4m and 4 gold points for a non-charm success and 10 more non-charm dice),</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">First Movement of the Demiurge (for each set of 3x7, 3x8, 3x9 or 3x10, turn a failed dice into a 10. That's 2 more successes of course, but also an extra dice to roll.)</span><br /> </span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:black\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><br /> For a level 4 or 5 Artefact, I'd go for:</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:black\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">Supreme Masterwork Focus x2 (1 gold point, 1wp, get double 8s)</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:black\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">Experiential Conjuring of the Void (spend 4m and 4 gold points for a non-charm success and 10 more non-charm dice),</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:black\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">Unbroken Image Focus (after rolling, you can buy 5+X non-charm successes in non-charm successes, at 1gp each, where X is 1 for each 7/8/9 you roll and 2 for each 10)</span></span><br /> <br /> Do you forumites agree?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-11T09:37:50-08:00","id":1367009,"title":"","content":"This character is Essence 4 since you\u2019re listing four Charms at once to get? In that case the Supreme Masterwork Focus x2 + Experimental Conjuring of True Void is already enough to make an Artifact 5 in five rolls. Matter of fact SMF x1 + ECoTV would be enough to make an Artifact 5 in six rolls which leaves two BFP Charms left to spend on CNNT and Thousand-Forge Hands if they don\u2019t already have TFH.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":13313,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13313-sith_happens","user":"Sith_Happens","date":". 02-11-2020, 12:40 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13313-sith_happens","name":"Sith_Happens","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13313_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1177"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-11T09:59:29-08:00","id":1367017,"title":"","content":"Crap, you're right, he's Essence 5, he gets 1 more than that.<br /> <br /> He does have Thousand-Forge Hands, he just doesn't have other Power charms.<br /> <br /> What's the most Craft-point-efficient set of 5 charms (+Flawless Handiwork Method) to make artefacts in 5 rolls or under? (Just in case he rolls badly and needs the 6th roll)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-11T10:05:14-08:00","id":1367020,"title":"","content":"Pretty sure SMFx2 and Divine Inspiration Technique (and prereqs).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13313-sith_happens","name":"Sith_Happens","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13313_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1177"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-11T10:12:42-08:00","id":1367022,"title":"","content":"The 6 Charms you need to get infinity successes on any project up to and including N/A are the following (all obtainable at E2) : <ol class=\"decimal\"><li>Flawless Handiwork Method</li> <li>Bright Forging Prana</li> <li>Supreme Masterwork Focus</li> <li>Supreme Masterwork Focus 2</li> <li>Experimental Conjuring of the Void</li> <li>First Movement of Demiurge</li> </ol><ul><li>Free Charm 1: Divine Inspiration Technique</li> <li>Free Charm 2: Supreme Masterwork Focus repurchase 3</li> <li>Free Charm 3: Flawless Handiwork Method Repurchase</li> </ul><br /> <br /> If you only have the first 2, then just use Bright Forging Prana to get whatever you're missing in order (so 3 4 5 6 then the Free Charms 1 2 3).<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25285-epitome","name":"Epitome","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25285_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"754"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-11T10:19:35-08:00","id":1367025,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sith_Happens</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1366995-bright-forging-prana-recommendations?p=1367009#post1367009\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Matter of fact SMF x1</div> </div> </div> </div>Doesn't that not work on Superior projects?<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-11T10:27:51-08:00","id":1367028,"title":"","content":"You know, I didn't even think of taking CNNT and Thousand-Forge Hands. My friend's character actually has them anyway.<br /> <br /> Which makes me realise at E5 you could play a guy who can craft ordinary stuff, just take Craftsman Needs No Tools (for your normal really fast crafting), Flawless Handiwork Methodology, and Bright-Forging Prana, and 1/story you can make an artefact of basically any level with a very minimal investment. You just need Craft (Artefact) 5 as well as your normal Craft ability. That's... very interesting. Not for this character, but it is interesting generally.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":2402,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","user":"The Wizard of Oz","date":". 02-11-2020, 01:33 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-11T10:32:37-08:00","id":1367029,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Epitome</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1366995-bright-forging-prana-recommendations?p=1367022#post1367022\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">infinity successes</div> </div> </div> </div>*75 successes per roll if my math is correct, but the difference is mostly academic at that point. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> EDIT: That\u2019s at E5, at E2 it\u2019s 65-66.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Wizard of Oz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1366995-bright-forging-prana-recommendations?p=1367025#post1367025\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Doesn't that not work on Superior projects?</div> </div> </div> </div>...Correct.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":13313,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13313-sith_happens","user":"Sith_Happens","date":". 02-11-2020, 01:38 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13313-sith_happens","name":"Sith_Happens","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13313_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1177"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}